 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a macabre horror adventure that will challenge your perceptions and test your resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/58e6c3c34a2d31eac357cf90b4575729.poster.avif?t=1756160890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/58e6c3c34a2d31eac357cf90b4575729.webm?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/58e6c3c34a2d31eac357cf90b4575729.mp4?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
